  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_BURN_NAME
    Text: Burn
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_BURN_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "Each burn tick deals extra magic damage equal to 1% of the enemy\u2019s
      max HP. Each additional level adds 0.05 percentage points."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_PROJECTILECRIT_NAME
    Text: Critical Shots
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_PROJECTILECRIT_DESCRIPTION
    Text: Projectiles have a 1% chance to deal double damage. Each additional level
      adds 1 percentage point.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_EXTRALOOTBOX_NAME
    Text: Extra Chest
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_EXTRALOOTBOX_DESCRIPTION
    Text: After all chests are opened, there is a 5% chance to spawn one more. Each
      additional level adds 0.025 percentage points.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_RUNSPEED_NAME
    Text: Movement Speed
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_RUNSPEED_DESCRIPTION
    Text: +1 movement speed per level.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_ATTACKSPEED_NAME
    Text: Attack Speed
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_ATTACKSPEED_DESCRIPTION
    Text: +1% attack speed per level.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_HEALING_NAME
    Text: Healing
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_HEALING_DESCRIPTION
    Text: +1% healing effectiveness per level.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_LIFESTEALARMOR_NAME
    Text: Lifesteal Armor
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_LIFESTEALARMOR_DESCRIPTION
    Text: Lifesteal grants armor equal to 15% of the health stolen for 5 seconds.
      Each additional level adds 1 armor.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_ITEMDROP_NAME
    Text: Item Drops
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_ITEMDROP_DESCRIPTION
    Text: Power-up drop chance increases by 1 percentage point. Each additional level
      adds 0.25 percentage points.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_REVIVEALLY_NAME
    Text: Raise Ally
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_REVIVEALLY_DESCRIPTION
    Text: Kills have a {0:0.##}% chance to raise an ally with its original attack
      and movement speed. It retains {1:0.##}% of its HP, damage, armor and magic
      resistance, plus {2:0.##} flat points to each stat per level.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_ARMOR_NAME
    Text: Armor
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_ARMOR_DESCRIPTION
    Text: +1 physical armor per level.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_MAGICARMOR_NAME
    Text: Magic Armor
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_MAGICARMOR_DESCRIPTION
    Text: +1 magic armor per level.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_PROJECTILEKNOCKBACK_NAME
    Text: Knockback
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_PROJECTILEKNOCKBACK_DESCRIPTION
    Text: Projectiles gain 1% of standard knockback. Each additional level adds 0.25
      percentage points.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_LOWHEALTHSHIELD_NAME
    Text: Last Stand Shield
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_LOWHEALTHSHIELD_DESCRIPTION
    Text: Below 30% HP, gain a shield equal to 50% of max HP that fades over 5 seconds.
      50-second cooldown, reduced by 0.2 seconds per additional level.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_HURTSPRINT_NAME
    Text: Burst of Speed
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_HURTSPRINT_DESCRIPTION
    Text: Taking damage continuously for 3 seconds increases movement speed by 10%
      for 3 seconds. 25-second cooldown, reduced by 0.1 seconds per additional level.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_QUESTREWARD_NAME
    Text: Quest Bonus
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_QUESTREWARD_DESCRIPTION
    Text: Completing a quest has a 5% chance to grant an extra card or support upgrade.
      Each additional level adds 0.25 percentage points.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_GIANTPROJECTILE_NAME
    Text: Giant Projectile
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_GIANTPROJECTILE_DESCRIPTION
    Text: 10% chance to fire a 35% larger projectile that deals 35% extra projectile
      damage plus 15% of Attack Damage. Each additional level adds 1 damage.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_OVERTIME_NAME
    Text: Overtime Boost
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_OVERTIME_DESCRIPTION
    Text: Gain 5% combat stats upon entering overtime. Each additional level adds
      0.2 percentage points.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_MISSINGHEALTH_NAME
    Text: Vengeance
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_MISSINGHEALTH_DESCRIPTION
    Text: Each 1% of missing HP adds 1% Attack Damage and attack speed. Each additional
      level adds 1 percentage point to that multiplier.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_SHIELDBURST_NAME
    Text: Shield Burst
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_SHIELDBURST_DESCRIPTION
    Text: Shields are 30% stronger. When a shield breaks, it pushes enemies back
      and deals 10 physical damage. Each additional level adds 1% burst damage.
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_REPEATABILITY_NAME
    Text: Double Cast
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_REPEATABILITY_DESCRIPTION
    Text: Abilities have a 50% chance to cast again. The repeat cast deals 10% of
      the original damage, plus 10 damage per additional level.
