      m\xE1u t\u1ED1i \u0111a c\u1EE7a t\u1EEBng qu\xE1i trong b\xE1n k\xEDnh {3}
      m. M\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p n\xE2ng th\xEAm {4} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng. H\u1ED3i
      chi\xEAu {5} gi\xE2y sau khi n\u1ED5."
