    Text: "R\u01B0\u01A1ng b\u1ED5 sung"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_EXTRALOOTBOX_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "Sau khi v\xE9t h\u1EBFt r\u01B0\u01A1ng, c\xF3 5% c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i sinh
      th\xEAm m\u1ED9t r\u01B0\u01A1ng. M\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p sau +0,025 \u0111i\u1EC3m
      %."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_RUNSPEED_NAME
    Text: "T\u1ED1c ch\u1EA1y"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_RUNSPEED_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "+1 t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 ch\u1EA1y m\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_ATTACKSPEED_NAME
    Text: "T\u1ED1c \u0111\xE1nh"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_ATTACKSPEED_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "+1% t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 \u0111\xE1nh m\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_HEALING_NAME
    Text: "H\u1ED3i m\xE1u"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_HEALING_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "+1% hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3 h\u1ED3i m\xE1u m\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_LIFESTEALARMOR_NAME
    Text: "H\xFAt m\xE1u"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_LIFESTEALARMOR_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "H\xFAt m\xE1u cho gi\xE1p b\u1EB1ng 15% l\u01B0\u1EE3ng m\xE1u h\xFAt
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c trong 5 gi\xE2y. M\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p sau +1 gi\xE1p."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_ITEMDROP_NAME
    Text: "R\u01A1i \u0111\u1ED3"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_ITEMDROP_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "T\u0103ng 1 \u0111i\u1EC3m % t\u1EC9 l\u1EC7 r\u01A1i v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m
      h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3. M\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p sau +0,25 \u0111i\u1EC3m %."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_REVIVEALLY_NAME
    Text: "H\u1ED3i sinh \u0111\u1EC7"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_REVIVEALLY_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "{0:0.##}% c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i h\u1ED3i sinh qu\xE1i v\u1EEBa h\u1EA1 th\xE0nh
      \u0111\u1EC7, gi\u1EEF nguy\xEAn t\u1ED1c \u0111\xE1nh v\xE0 t\u1ED1c ch\u1EA1y.
      \u0110\u1EC7 gi\u1EEF {1:0.##}% m\xE1u, s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng, gi\xE1p v\xE0
      kh\xE1ng ph\xE9p g\u1ED1c, r\u1ED3i c\u1ED9ng th\u1EB3ng {2:0.##} \u0111i\u1EC3m
      v\xE0o t\u1EEBng ch\u1EC9 s\u1ED1 m\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_ARMOR_NAME
    Text: "Gi\xE1p v\u1EADt l\xFD"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_ARMOR_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "+1 gi\xE1p v\u1EADt l\xFD m\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_MAGICARMOR_NAME
    Text: "Gi\xE1p ph\xE9p"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_MAGICARMOR_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "+1 gi\xE1p ph\xE9p m\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_PROJECTILEKNOCKBACK_NAME
    Text: "\u0110\u1EA9y l\xF9i"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_PROJECTILEKNOCKBACK_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "\u0110\u1EA1n nh\u1EADn l\u1EF1c \u0111\u1EA9y l\xF9i b\u1EB1ng 1% l\u1EF1c
      chu\u1EA9n. M\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p sau +0,25 \u0111i\u1EC3m %."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_LOWHEALTHSHIELD_NAME
    Text: "Khi\xEAn m\xE1u th\u1EA5p"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_LOWHEALTHSHIELD_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "D\u01B0\u1EDBi 30% m\xE1u nh\u1EADn khi\xEAn b\u1EB1ng 50% m\xE1u t\u1ED1i
      \u0111a, gi\u1EA3m d\u1EA7n trong 5 gi\xE2y. H\u1ED3i chi\xEAu 50 gi\xE2y,
      m\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p sau -0,2 gi\xE2y."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_HURTSPRINT_NAME
    Text: "B\u1ED9c ph\xE1t t\u1ED1c"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_HURTSPRINT_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "Ch\u1ECBu s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng li\xEAn t\u1EE5c 3 gi\xE2y s\u1EBD t\u0103ng
      10% t\u1ED1c ch\u1EA1y trong 3 gi\xE2y. H\u1ED3i chi\xEAu 25 gi\xE2y, m\u1ED7i
      c\u1EA5p sau -0,1 gi\xE2y."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_QUESTREWARD_NAME
    Text: "Th\u01B0\u1EDFng nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_QUESTREWARD_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "Ho\xE0n th\xE0nh nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 c\xF3 5% c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i nh\u1EADn
      th\xEAm th\u1EBB ho\u1EB7c n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p b\u1ED5 tr\u1EE3. M\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p
      sau +0,25 \u0111i\u1EC3m %."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_GIANTPROJECTILE_NAME
    Text: "\u0110\u1EA1n kh\u1ED5ng l\u1ED3"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_GIANTPROJECTILE_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "10% c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i b\u1EAFn \u0111\u1EA1n to h\u01A1n 35%, th\xEAm 35%
      s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u1EA1n + 15% AD. M\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p sau +1 s\xE1t
      th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_OVERTIME_NAME
    Text: "Hack gi\u1EDD"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_OVERTIME_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "V\xE0o hi\u1EC7p ph\u1EE5 t\u0103ng 5% ch\u1EC9 s\u1ED1 chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u.
      M\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p sau +0,2 \u0111i\u1EC3m %."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_MISSINGHEALTH_NAME
    Text: "Ph\u1EE5c h\u1EADn"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_MISSINGHEALTH_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "M\u1ED7i 1% m\xE1u \u0111\xE3 m\u1EA5t t\u0103ng 1% AD v\xE0 t\u1ED1c
      \u0111\xE1nh. M\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p sau +1 \u0111i\u1EC3m % v\xE0o h\u1EC7 s\u1ED1
      n\xE0y."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_SHIELDBURST_NAME
    Text: "Khi\xEAn ph\xE1"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_SHIELDBURST_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "Khi\xEAn m\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n 30%. Khi v\u1EE1, khi\xEAn \u0111\u1EA9y nh\u1EB9
      v\xE0 g\xE2y 10 s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1EADt l\xFD. M\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p sau
      +1% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1EE5 n\u1ED5."
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_REPEATABILITY_NAME
    Text: "X2 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADE_REPEATABILITY_DESCRIPTION
    Text: "50% c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i thi tri\u1EC3n th\xEAm m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n khi tung
      k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng. L\u1EA7n l\u1EB7p g\xE2y th\xEAm 10% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      g\u1ED1c, m\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p sau +10 s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - Name: SUPPORT_RARITY_COMMON
    Text: "Th\u01B0\u1EDDng"
  - Name: SUPPORT_RARITY_RARE
    Text: "Hi\u1EBFm"
  - Name: SUPPORT_RARITY_EPIC
    Text: "S\u1EED thi"
  - Name: SUPPORT_RARITY_LEGENDARY
    Text: "Huy\u1EC1n tho\u1EA1i"
  - Name: SUPPORT_UPGRADES_HEADING
    Text: "N\xE2ng c\u1EA5p b\u1ED5 tr\u1EE3"
